# The payload must arrive byte-for-byte: MANIFEST.sha256 was generated from
# the originals, and seven of the poms are CRLF as served by Maven Central.
# Marking everything under maven-central/ binary stops git normalising any of
# it. The manifest itself is binary too, so sha256sum -c parses it cleanly.
maven-central/** binary
MANIFEST.sha256 binary
*.md text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
